## Phase 7: Monitoring & Logging

### 7.1 Sensitive Data Redaction

```javascript
const redactSensitiveData = (obj, sensitiveKeys = ['password', 'token', 'ssn']) => {
  const cloned = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(obj));
  const redact = (o) => {
    for (const key in o) {
      if (sensitiveKeys.includes(key)) {
        o[key] = '[REDACTED]';
      } else if (typeof o[key] === 'object' && o[key] !== null) {
        redact(o[key]);
      }
    }
  };
  redact(cloned);
  return cloned;
};

// Usage in logging
logger.info({
  event: 'LOGIN',
  data: redactSensitiveData(req.body),
});
```

