### 🎯 PRIORITY FIXES (In Order)

| Priority | Issue | Impact |
|----------|-------|--------|
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No Authentication | Anyone can access user data |
| 🔴 CRITICAL | No Input Validation | SQL/Code Injection possible |
| 🟠 HIGH | No Security Headers | XSS, Clickjacking, MIME sniffing |
| 🟠 HIGH | No Rate Limiting | DoS vulnerability |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | No CORS Policy | CSRF attacks |
| 🟡 MEDIUM | Sensitive Data Exposure | Privacy violation |
