### Issue #8: Error Handling & Information Disclosure

**BEFORE (VULNERABLE):**
```javascript
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  // Exposes sensitive information
  res.status(500).json({
    error: err.message,
    stack: err.stack,
    file: err.filename
  });
});
```

**AFTER (SECURE):**
```javascript
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  // Log internally
  console.error('Error:', err);

  // Generic response to client
  res.status(err.status || 500).json({
    error: 'Internal server error'
    // Never expose: stack, message, internals
  });
});

// Also disable X-Powered-By header
app.disable('x-powered-by');
```

