================================================================================
COMPREHENSIVE SECURITY REVIEW OF app.js
================================================================================

EXECUTIVE SUMMARY:
The application has several critical security issues that need to be addressed
before production deployment. This review covers OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities
and common web application security concerns.

================================================================================
CRITICAL FINDINGS (Priority: HIGH)
================================================================================

1. MISSING AUTHENTICATION/AUTHORIZATION (OWASP A07:2021 - Identification & Auth)
   ---
   ISSUE: No authentication mechanism exists

   Location: /users endpoint (line 8-12)

   Current Code:
   ```javascript
