const api_key = 'sk_live_xyz123'; // ❌ HARDCODED!
```

**Security Issues:**
- Secrets in version control
- Exposed in GitHub if public
- Same secret in all environments
- Hard to rotate

#### ✅ SECURE
```javascript
// .env file (never committed to git)
require('dotenv').config();

const JWT_SECRET = process.env.JWT_SECRET;
const API_KEY = process.env.API_KEY;

// Validate required variables
if (NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  const requiredEnvVars = ['JWT_SECRET', 'ALLOWED_ORIGINS'];
  const missingEnvVars = requiredEnvVars.filter((envVar) => !process.env[envVar]);

  if (missingEnvVars.length > 0) {
    console.error(`Missing required environment variables: ${missingEnvVars.join(', ')}`);
    process.exit(1);
  }
}

// .gitignore to prevent accidental commits
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
```

**Best Practices:**
- Secrets in environment variables only
- Different secrets per environment
- Validation at startup
- `.gitignore` prevents accidents

