|---|---|---|---|
| No Authentication | CRITICAL | A1/A7 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| Missing Input Validation | HIGH | A3 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| Sensitive Data Exposure | HIGH | A2 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| Missing Security Headers | HIGH | A5 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| No Logging/Monitoring | MEDIUM | A9 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| Poor Error Handling | HIGH | A5 | ❌ Not Implemented |
| No Environment Variables | MEDIUM | A5 | ❌ Not Implemented |

---

