## SOLUTION 5: Secrets Manager Class (Best Practice)

Use the `SecretsManager` class from `app_secure_secrets.js`:

```javascript
class SecretsManager {
  async initialize(backend = 'env') {
    switch (backend) {
      case 'aws':
        await this.loadFromAWSSecretsManager();
        break;
      case 'vault':
        await this.loadFromHashicorpVault();
        break;
      case 'env':
      default:
        this.loadFromEnv();
    }

    this.validateCriticalSecrets();
  }

  validateCriticalSecrets() {
    // FAIL FAST - no fallbacks
    if (!this.secrets.JWT_SECRET) {
      throw new Error('JWT_SECRET is required');
    }
  }
}

// Usage
