COMMON INJECTION ATTACK EXAMPLES
=================================

SQL Injection:
  VULNERABLE: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${req.params.id}
  Attack: ?id=1; DROP TABLE users;--
  SECURE: Use parameterized queries/ORMs

NoSQL Injection:
