XSS:
  VULNERABLE: res.send(`<div>${req.body.text}</div>`)
  Attack: <script>alert('xss')</script>
  SECURE: Use xss-clean middleware + escaping

Command Injection:
  VULNERABLE: exec(`rm ${filename}`)
  Attack: filename=test.txt; cat /etc/passwd
  SECURE: Use child_process with arguments array

