  → Add structured logging with winston/bunyan

A10:2021 - Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)
  ⚠ LOW RISK: Not applicable to current code
  → Relevant if external requests added

================================================================================
IMPLEMENTATION PRIORITY
================================================================================

IMMEDIATE (This Week):
