## 🔄 SECRET ROTATION STRATEGY

### **Current Problem:**
- No rotation mechanism
- If JWT_SECRET is compromised, all tokens remain valid
- Database passwords can't be rotated without downtime

### **Recommended Rotation Plan:**

```javascript
// ✅ SECURE - JWT Secret Rotation
class SecretManager {
  constructor(vault) {
    this.vault = vault;
    this.currentSecret = null;
    this.previousSecrets = [];
    this.lastRotation = null;
  }

  async initialize() {
    const secrets = await this.vault.read('secret/data/app/jwt-secrets');
    this.currentSecret = secrets.data.data.current;
    this.previousSecrets = secrets.data.data.previous || [];
    this.lastRotation = new Date(secrets.data.data.rotatedAt);
  }

  async rotateSecret() {
    // Generate new secret
    const newSecret = crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('hex');

    // Archive current
    this.previousSecrets.push(this.currentSecret);
    this.currentSecret = newSecret;

    // Store in vault
    await this.vault.write('secret/data/app/jwt-secrets', {
      current: newSecret,
      previous: this.previousSecrets.slice(-5), // Keep last 5
      rotatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),
    });

    logger.info('JWT secret rotated successfully');
  }

  verifyToken(token) {
    // Try current secret
    try {
      return jwt.verify(token, this.currentSecret);
    } catch (err) {
      // Try previous secrets (for grace period)
      for (const oldSecret of this.previousSecrets) {
        try {
          return jwt.verify(token, oldSecret);
        } catch (e) {
          // Continue
        }
      }
      throw new Error('Invalid token');
    }
  }
}

// Usage
const secretManager = new SecretManager(vault);
await secretManager.initialize();

// Rotate daily or on-demand
setInterval(() => secretManager.rotateSecret(), 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);
```

**Rotation Schedule Recommendations:**
- JWT_SECRET: Daily or weekly
- Database passwords: Monthly
- API keys: Monthly  
- Database credentials: Quarterly
