| Store passwords in plaintext | Hash with bcrypt/argon2 |
| Commit `.env` files | Add to `.gitignore` |
| Return detailed error messages | Return generic errors in production |
| Trust all user input | Validate and sanitize everything |
| Hardcode configuration | Use environment variables |
| Allow all CORS origins | Whitelist specific origins |
| Skip authentication | Require valid JWT/session |
| Use HTTP in production | Enforce HTTPS with HSTS |
| Log sensitive data | Only log safe information |
| Skip rate limiting | Implement per-endpoint limits |

