### **7. No HTTPS Enforcement (OWASP A02:2021 - Cryptographic Failures)**

**Issue:** Application runs on HTTP without forcing HTTPS.

**Recommended Fix:**
```javascript
const https = require('https');
const fs = require('fs');

app.use((req, res, next) => {
  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production' && req.header('x-forwarded-proto') !== 'https') {
